<title>HONG KONG: Sime Darby HK interim net up 85 percent.</title>
<headline>Sime Darby HK interim net up 85 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   35.4    vs 19.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    16.0    vs 12.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    165.0   vs 89.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		     4,225.1 vs 3,667.3</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sime Darby Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 25-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Sime Darby Hong Kong distributes motor vehicles and heavy construction equipment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
